                <syllable xml:id="m-5570b38e-a8a7-4064-b2e9-0cdc24484030">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-86534105-41a3-4a8a-bebb-97ebf0ba00ec" type="punctum" xml:id="m-9b0bfe55-d51b-408f-9938-f178ef87447b">
                    <nc xml:id="m-a5bc3256-fee8-4cfb-a1f1-d250655019bd" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-e98cfd06-11c4-4eef-b36b-c6f6d670e7c0">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-ce6feb76-c5a5-45b0-bb43-99dfa3dbdce4" type="punctum" xml:id="m-b4395b55-177f-4ba6-b120-3a15bc91ccd5">
                    <nc xml:id="m-f8b87267-d944-49c6-b106-4496f1a7891e" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-9e0916b4-2079-4ff9-8eb4-d8520b6fe4a6">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-66e1ea68-8a05-4c8c-8b9c-7fff8b2da41f" type="punctum" xml:id="m-47427509-5c67-455c-aee3-92cfa0e0cef7">
                    <nc xml:id="m-25fa5a51-314d-400a-9466-2d3691786908" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-b39bf032-5c6c-4aa9-b1ab-38ef268f5e4a" facs="#m-b97f520f-3a3f-428a-95f3-39c73af3f5c1" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-f80a0597-20aa-44db-bfd6-d6b6d9ac4590">
              <lg xml:id="m-61702b91-6f28-4e1f-9c12-e9c331caf705">
                <l xml:id="m-7a34d72c-6744-48c3-82be-9b484c475c32" facs="#m-7f2f36c4-d963-44d1-aac7-068a8142ee44" label="text-like">2799Antiphons and Psalms at the Little Hours</l><l xml:id="m-718c6c48-e94d-45b8-9a1c-da677659e07f" facs="#m-dc014aa9-96b4-44d1-a42d-b73d70c7b1c1" label="lyrics-like">6. Ego dixi: Dii éstis, *et filii Excétsi ômnes.</l><l xml:id="m-f61617af-5be5-4849-a2c2-bd61f668a425" facs="#m-1fda9b3b-5e0e-4287-bb28-bc37ca071553" label="lyrics-like">7. Vos autem sicut hómines moriémini:* et sicut únus de princípibus</l><l xml:id="m-2f45efcb-a4d5-409e-954c-01a822841f92" facs="#m-a728d789-7fdb-4e2e-9822-4def7fe7a0ab" label="lyrics-like">cadétis.</l><l xml:id="m-11561e1e-1a0f-4aed-bc26-4753eca6d918" facs="#m-a431068e-c5c5-44fb-a041-1096cb9e12d7" label="lyrics-like">8. Súrge, Déus, júdica térram:* quóniam tu haereditábis in ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-aa9a5775-813d-49f9-bbea-195b73ecb0e3" facs="#m-9285c519-6e0c-4fca-9c16-c7ce79628bb0" label="lyrics-like">géntibus.</l><l xml:id="m-f4fae8d0-fe0e-43dc-bfd6-a3cd5486bfde" facs="#m-44db1ec9-ffa8-4da8-8cd5-e8ce73d5f971" label="ambiguous">An- &amp;</l><l xml:id="m-9103ae9a-7da8-43b1-8483-fe952ced3239" facs="#m-15049f3f-034e-4ade-8a0b-a3177d9909b7" label="ambiguous">tiphon.—</l><l xml:id="m-012f070d-6394-41f2-9117-a1a97c2b5a16" facs="#m-340620ed-7585-40c8-a847-fd7784994da3" label="lyrics-like">Exci-ta, Dómine, pot-énti-am tú-am, ut sálvos fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a7ddece2-93a4-4be1-ae15-fcc4387d960f" facs="#m-8bb44102-8700-436b-bd88-ea606e551159" label="ambiguous">ci-as nos.</l><l xml:id="m-30557910-cfc8-430b-bd36-99409f63da5b" facs="#m-469c6ae9-8632-4e6f-9ca6-c27e3ac61ff8" label="text-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Alleluia, alleltia, alleluia. p. 239.</l><l xml:id="m-c0bebcec-709a-4b22-8d90-88b33702a566" facs="#m-194af586-1a56-4c86-8775-d5f881fc596a" label="text-like">FRIDAY AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-e5f6638e-51f3-4368-9209-33d8bde85cec" facs="#m-9805bd50-4896-4fad-bd89-f30867996287" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-f17aef10-e490-49cc-99c1-614f80803f45" facs="#m-00881f05-8553-46f0-b7b3-a61d1072fdb4" label="ambiguous">8.d</l><l xml:id="m-2814c07c-b65c-4af8-b68f-30897f78f65b" facs="#m-095f898d-df34-4c32-bd53-bfff13cc646d" label="lyrics-like">E-á-i qui hábi-tant. Eu o "a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8fd5f83-6acd-402c-9623-b55631d2ad33" facs="#m-27b2216f-5e7b-4df9-bdee-5ea5dd7cfed7" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 241.</l><l xml:id="m-ecde1f63-5b88-4fa1-aad1-74b52cb3ba53" facs="#m-82d5c787-3171-4956-a120-774b97f4152a" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 83. I. Quam dilécta. YV. 1-7, D. 936.</l><l xml:id="m-5109af5b-55d4-4f61-adde-93651ae4001f" facs="#m-997f0124-efb0-4129-aec7-bf836ac6f83f" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 83. H. Dómine, Déus virtútum. YV. 8-15.</l><l xml:id="m-880be6ae-6e65-4ff5-b79e-42cc8f8b80e4" facs="#m-da401ae2-ae10-4fb6-9712-5a2e19ea4d54" label="ambiguous">Psalm 86.</l><l xml:id="m-69b3d89a-4667-4f63-bf92-72e22ec87f38" facs="#m-dadaae4d-e243-4b3c-b72c-69b0c2543d13" label="lyrics-like">yUndaménta éjus in móntibus sánctis:“ diligit Dóminus pórtas Sion</l><l xml:id="m-b2c60f3c-bf7c-4729-8d5f-1a0c029bd794" facs="#m-361e5acd-ac79-45f9-9b95-46b3ed9ecc8a" label="lyrics-like">super ómnia tabernácula Jácob.</l><l xml:id="m-c1d4e7d6-66cf-48bc-afde-189a656adb9a" facs="#m-7e655b66-13d7-47f9-b8dd-348054824318" label="lyrics-like">2. Gloriósa dicta sunt de te, * civitas Déi.</l><l xml:id="m-a03fafd4-4d05-432c-ba29-e223f02d94ec" facs="#m-ca34fa08-537e-46a0-9519-9e362651a442" label="lyrics-like">3. Mémor éro Ráhab et Babylónis* sciéntium me.</l><l xml:id="m-8025f9f2-13e9-41d9-b28b-bc173f6b4566" facs="#m-22471c3e-4df8-4796-887b-8935d1aded40" label="lyrics-like">4. Ecce alienígenae, et Tyrus, et pópulus Æthiopum, “hi fuérunt</l><l xml:id="m-2d764419-e758-48bf-b6ac-7b688d0604a7" facs="#m-14059a70-1a89-4d93-b045-758bac3a995b" label="ambiguous">ulic.</l><l xml:id="m-045cc170-8093-4777-aa00-9bb223da80af" facs="#m-3504cc28-e0ce-4809-ac23-75231c64f3c6" label="lyrics-like">5. Númquid Sion dícet : † Hómo, et hómo nátus est in éa :* et spse</l><l xml:id="m-368f1736-1ebc-40c3-8346-fbdeb21b7c3c" facs="#m-efe94d2e-9138-4d08-ad2e-e30046dd287b" label="lyrics-like">fundávit éam Altissimus?</l><l xml:id="m-223843d9-ed18-48d3-9981-412fd142527b" facs="#m-22c70fe3-c6e4-424d-86ce-d465a1ca4e9b" label="lyrics-like">6. Dóminus narrábit in scriptúris populórum et principum :“hórur</l><l xml:id="m-e90410b7-5e1e-4177-8d91-3e097320947f" facs="#m-09ec0b93-91e7-4fd8-af84-7854a8f4d8b8" label="lyrics-like">qui fuérunt in éa.</l><l xml:id="m-1ab70ff5-f362-4f12-b48e-cd513ab819aa" facs="#m-0dbf325a-e1a8-4ebf-8816-884f3ebbd561" label="lyrics-like">8. Sicut laetántium ómnium * habitátio est in te.</l><l xml:id="m-21416573-3e51-4871-8e66-45366d6c9ec8" facs="#m-dc18b236-70b1-4f61-851c-0a0705f0ee5f" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a85dc51-01f4-47da-9d35-ee6399e16747" facs="#m-16f8cd1b-02de-4233-b16d-013b9a30e389" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-dbd3bccd-aed0-4dab-94dd-e8b4bd400d07" facs="#m-0c1dd85f-5318-4073-8d04-c026c31ee78b" label="lyrics-like">Be-á-ti qui hábi-tant in dómo tú-a, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-a32735fc-b6f3-49f3-870c-bfdd521311ca" facs="#m-3a7a36b5-4887-4a7b-a7ba-247ab763d81d" label="text-like">In Paschal Time: Ant. Alleluia, alleluia, alleluia. p. 244.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>